    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2031013178507952358",
      "url": "https://x.com/QCGov/status/2031013178507952358",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2031013178507952358",
      "text": "Agarang tulong sa bawat QCitizen!✨\n\nTinitiyak ng Quezon City Government na ang bawat pamilyang naapektuhan ng nagdaang sunog ay mabibigyan ng sapat at agarang tulong ayon sa kanilang pangangailangan.\n\nMakakaasa kayong patuloy na nakaalalay ang lokal na pamahalaan upang matulungan ang mga QCitizens na makabangon at makapagsimula muli.\n\nPanoorin ang weekly recap na ito para sa linggo ng March 2, 2026. Makikita ang iba pang detalye sa:\n\n•  Brgy. Pinyahan Fire Assistance:\nhttps://t.co/huMmy4zxSx\n\nhttps://t.co/7uQ6usvLlP\n\nhttps://t.co/W4hgC9GUSc\n\nhttps://t.co/ovHoAP2LRf\n\nhttps://t.co/Izv2y3qr2A\n\nhttps://t.co/f5WWRaqkb3\n\nhttps://t.co/Gv4hghiyB8\n\n• Women’s Month KickOff Ceremony:\nhttps://t.co/6AXvgncNJv\n\n• Block Screening of Sisa:\nhttps://t.co/ekOfj9goOH\n\n• Kababaihan Festival: Inter department Dance Competition:\nhttps://t.co/bFa0D7gugZ\n\n• Local Legislative Awards:\nhttps://t.co/ql266R7sTo\n\n•  World Obesity Day:\nhttps://t.co/70Tkx6anYP\n\n• Launching of Project VOLTA:\nhttps://t.co/nv0nYzMD4W\n\n•   QCU 32nd Founding Anniversary:\nhttps://t.co/bdQrq7lsQr\n\n• Inauguration of the Quezon City Health Department (QCHD) Water and Drug Testing Laboratories\nhttps://t.co/nVHjKMoGg8\n\n• Japan Ambassador Endo Kazuya Visit:\nhttps://t.co/z4mr0E9NhS\n\n#BusyQCWeeklyRecap",
